These source headers license the wrapper and command-line parser under Apache-2.0.
The bundled JAR contains the wrapper and command-line parser; it does not
contain the other libraries in the full Gradle distribution.
The configured bootstrap downloads Gradle 9.4.1 separately. That distribution
is a build tool and is not included in Pactick's source archive or Android APK.
